From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:01:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fence Runtime cancellation against terminal failures and
 deadlines [skip ci]

Compare stored task state and attempt identity in both cancellation updates. Reject expiry at the write and reuse the durable deadline reaper around canonical cancellation. Add deterministic real-store committed-failure, successor and deadline regressions.
